["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Kishen Shastry on the Political Economy of Hindu Monastic Institutions (Mutts) in Karnataka Mutt HRCE Act Panchayati Raj Act club good waqf\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-ideasofindia-印度教修道院越密集的地区-选举优势反而被压缩0-7个百分点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c0c3c2c705693720-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">53:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ideas of India</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>印度教修道院越密集的地區，選舉優勢反而被壓縮0.7個百分點</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這些修道院從不固定支持哪個黨，哪派條件開得好就倒向哪派，這種搖擺地位反而讓周邊選區選情更膠著。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宗教經濟學</span><span class=\"tag\">印度政治經濟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: A Level We Shouldn&#x27;t Pass? Notes from The Curve + Tokens vs. Salaries &amp; Is SaaS Cooked? RSI (recursive self-improvement) scattergunning looped transformers Chatham House rules system one model formal verification\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-cogrev-前沿实验室高管罕见松口-存在一个我们不该越过的智能水平/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2934e3bfa922ab83-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>前沿實驗室高管罕見鬆口：存在一個我們不該越過的智能水平</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">被追問是否該給下一次預訓練設算力上限（約10^27 FLOPs）時，這位高管沒有反對，只說了一句「這可能合理」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力上限</span><span class=\"tag\">內存瓶頸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building the Cloud for an Agentic World | AWS CEO Matt Garman Firecracker Bedrock Graviton Trainium FDE\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-a16z-aws故意不把gpu全卖给头部模型公司-专留配额给初创企业/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>AWS故意不把GPU全賣給頭部模型公司，專留配額給初創企業</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AWS營收裡30%到40%來自曾經的初創公司，這是Garman解釋為何即便算力緊缺、本可一天賣光給大模型實驗室，也要刻意為小公司留GPU配額的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力分配</span><span class=\"tag\">自研芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Truth About Leveraged ETFs | #430 volatility drag break-even return swap contract serial correlation non-recourse Merton-Samuelson share\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-rationalreminder-杠杆etf的每日重置被冤枉了-拖累收益的真正元凶是波动率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>槓桿ETF的每日重置被冤枉了：拖累收益的真正元兇是波動率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多項新研究證明，槓桿ETF因每日重置導致長期跑輸的舊說法站不住腳，真正拖累收益的是標的資產本身的波動率，而非再平衡頻率。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">槓桿ETF</span><span class=\"tag\">波動率拖累</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Everyone Gets Wrong About the Economic Problems in Europe PPP (Purchasing Power Parity) deflator near-frontier models joint decision trap Industrial Accelerator Act\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-oddlots-那条让欧洲集体焦虑的生产率差距曲线-其实是统计口径造出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">52:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>那條讓歐洲集體焦慮的生產率差距曲線，其實是統計口徑造出來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Draghi報告里歐美從90%掉到70%的產出差距，很大程度源於兩地對GDP價格平減指數的計算方式不同，而非真實生產率差距。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歐洲經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">購買力平價</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"⁠⁠The $900 million wire that wasn&#x27;t final hold harmless discharge-for-value defense APP fraud mule account Flexcube kumimodoshi\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-complexsys-花旗误转8-9亿美元-法院一度判收款方无须退还/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/04f8139af18d15e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">33:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>花旗誤轉8.9億美元，法院一度判收款方無須退還</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">終局性不是支付方式自帶的屬性，而由關係、規則和管轄法律共同決定——花旗這筆誤轉最終靠的是上訴法院，而不是行業慣例裡那通電話。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">支付終局性</span><span class=\"tag\">電匯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"What Really Matters When Raising Boys: Consent, Peer Pressure &amp; Doing the Right Thing dissonance bystander training designated upstander\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-goodinside-男孩懂-同意-的道理-但没人教他们忍受失望的本事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">44:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>男孩懂「同意」的道理，但沒人教他們忍受失望的本事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">知道該尊重「不」只是起點，男孩真正缺的是扛住被拒絕、讀懂對方猶豫、在同伴都無所謂時仍信自己的情緒技能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">養育</span><span class=\"tag\">男孩教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"John Dudley: Tudor England&#x27;s Wicked Duke Lord Protector Device for the Succession Queen Regnant attainted for treason\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-historyhit-三年前镇压的叛军倒戈-把这位都铎权臣送上断头台/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9f68700f4e1f904-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">42:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>三年前鎮壓的叛軍倒戈，把這位都鐸權臣送上斷頭臺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">諾森伯蘭公爵都德利靠果斷手腕掌控英格蘭四年，卻在起兵阻止瑪麗稱後時，撞上了自己四年前在東英吉利屠殺過的那批民眾，轉頭支持了瑪麗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">都鐸王朝</span><span class=\"tag\">宮廷政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"510 – Exchequers and ExBalancers: Part One Exchequer murdrum county farm tally stick wapentake blanch payment\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-britishhist-英格兰王权扩张靠的不是骑士-而是记住谁欠了钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>英格蘭王權擴張靠的不是騎士，而是記住誰欠了錢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中世紀英格蘭沒有現代官僚機構，但靠一張寫著某人欠12先令的羊皮紙和一套環環相扣的核賬流程，照樣能跨郡追繳欠稅。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世紀英格蘭</span><span class=\"tag\">財政制度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Vol.133｜和開發者、投資人聊 Agent 遊戲：AI 改變了遊戲生產，能顛覆遊戲本身嗎？ Agent Multi-Agent Vibe Coding Behavior Tree Emergence Engineering Godot\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-linkstart-ai游戏最大的问题被摆上桌面-说到底还是不够好玩/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8b02943fa9b8d328-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"開\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">開始連接 LinkStart</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>AI遊戲最大的問題被擺上桌面：說到底還是不夠好玩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三位嘉賓在這期裡反覆回到一個尷尬共識：Agent遊戲概念很熱，但「好不好玩」這道最基礎的門檻，行業內部自己都還沒邁過去，遠談不上留存和付費。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent遊戲</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型應用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"712. The Terror: The Fall of Robespierre (Part 6) Thermidor sans-culottes Committee of Public Safety Committee of General Security Girondins Montagnard\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-restishistory-推翻罗伯斯庇尔的人-个个都是恐怖统治最狂热的执行者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>推翻羅伯斯庇爾的人，個個都是恐怖統治最狂熱的執行者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科隆、比約、巴雷爾、富歇、塔利安——扳倒他的人全是恐怖統治的得力打手，「恐怖統治」這個說法本身也是他們事後發明用來甩鍋的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法國大革命</span><span class=\"tag\">恐怖統治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"He Sold His Dad&#x27;s Shoes on eBay at 12. At 25 He Built a $4B Company Solo. | Ali Ansari, micro1 environments CDP (Company Data Partnerships) rollouts as a service post-training as a service\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-solofounders-从未听过-联合创始人-他却说自己不算单人创始人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85ffc60e3757bb9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>從未聽過「聯合創始人」，他卻說自己不算單人創始人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">申請YC時他才第一次聽說「聯合創始人」這個詞，想不出任何必須要有的理由——但他說micro1能走到今天，靠的正是一支幾乎等同於聯合創始人的創始團隊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">單人創始人</span><span class=\"tag\">AI訓練數據</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: What the Best CEOs Actually Do corner office isolation winner&#x27;s curse\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-mastersinbiz-ceo本身只能解释公司业绩15-的差异-跟换个行业影响相当/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75607265d740832-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">20:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>CEO本身只能解釋公司業績15%的差異，跟換個行業影響相當</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">20年業績數據拆解顯示：宏觀佔5%、行業佔15%、公司本身佔25%,CEO本人只解釋15%的業績差異——但換一個CEO,影響可以大到相當於換個行業。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CEO</span><span class=\"tag\">企業治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Why Every Traded Personal Agents for One Company Agent Dots OpenClaw Tend\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-aiandi-个人ai代理大多会被放弃-公司共用的那一个反而越养越强/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e9fedf7ee100ded0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">33:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>個人AI代理大多會被放棄，公司共用的那一個反而越養越強</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Every 的個人代理大多被員工主動放棄，因為普通人撐不住維護成本；只有持續被投餵的公司級代理越用越強，最終被做成了對外產品。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">組織設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Software That Never Breaks: OutSystems CEO Woodson Martin on Building Enterprise-Grade Apps at ... vibe coding MCP (Model Context Protocol) LLM router agent foundry\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-cogrev-ai写代码的时代-永不宕机-靠的是不让ai直接碰代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5ea531377217e680-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>AI寫代碼的時代，「永不宕機」靠的是不讓AI直接碰代碼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OutSystems讓AI編輯的是應用的抽象模型而非代碼本身，再確定性生成代碼，於是每個新應用自動繼承權限管控與合規設定，比裸寫代碼的Vibe Coding更難出故障。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業軟件</span><span class=\"tag\">AI代碼生成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Two Screaming Skulls Screaming Skull Monmouth Rebellion Bloody Assizes indentured servant\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-stuffmissed-传说中那具黑人男仆头骨-法医鉴定后竟是数千年前欧洲女性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">33:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>傳說中那具黑人男僕頭骨，法醫鑑定後竟是數千年前歐洲女性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">貝迪斯科姆莊園的「尖叫頭骨」傳說被渲染成一名黑人男僕的冤魂故事，但法醫鑑定顯示頭骨其實是一名數千年前的歐洲女性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英國歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">民間傳說</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Third Parties Are On the Rise. America Could Be Next. majoritarian electoral system proportional representation wasted vote\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-goodfight-两党支持率同步创新低-美国出现强势第三方的概率正在上升/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>兩黨支持率同步創新低，美國出現強勢第三方的概率正在上升</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國獨立選民數量已追平兩黨選民總和，而兩黨好感度罕見地同時下跌、不再此消彼長——這種組合正鬆動過去壓垮第三方的制度性障礙。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國政治</span><span class=\"tag\">第三方政黨</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Valon Rebuilt a $13 Trillion Industry From Scratch UPB (Unpaid Principal Balance) non-QM loans champion challenger revenue cycle management\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-a16z-重建13万亿美元抵押贷款行业-他们先自己做六年服务商再卖软件/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">40:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>重建13萬億美元抵押貸款行業，他們先自己做六年服務商再賣軟件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">行業不信任沒驗證過的新系統，Valon於是自己先做六年抵押貸款服務商證明技術可行，再把系統當軟件反向賣給整個行業。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">抵押貸款服務</span><span class=\"tag\">企業軟件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"‘This Is Nuts.’ An OpenAI Insider Explains Why He Quit. system card chain of thought spoofing RSI (recursive self-improvement) pacing the frontier\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-ezra-openai-安全高管离职-我们在用初创公司的节奏赌核电站级风险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 安全高管離職：我們在用初創公司的節奏賭核電站級風險</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他不確定AI會不會導致人類滅絕，但確信現在的安全把關跟不上模型進化速度——公司內部甚至無法確定新模型是否在測試時說謊、部署後變了樣。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Is the UK state pension really the lowest in Europe? Purchasing Power Parity (PPP) triple lock excess deaths\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-moreorless-英国养老金垫底的那张图-比的根本不是同一件事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">28:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>英國養老金墊底的那張圖，比的根本不是同一件事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">網傳那張「英國養老金歐洲墊底」的圖表，把不同國家統計口徑完全不同的數字硬湊一起比；拆開看，英國退休者收入佔比和貧困率其實都不差，差的是靠國家還是靠私人養老金。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">養老金</span><span class=\"tag\">統計誤導</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.130 中國超市進化論 ：聊山姆、奧樂齊、金粒門爆火背後 SKU PB PDQ CBS\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-nengzheduolao-开发成本一样-但规模碾压-开市客在中国追不上山姆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/561381e54726a681-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"能\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">能者多嘮｜商業原聲</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>開發成本一樣，但規模碾壓：開市客在中國追不上山姆</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">山姆早年就扎進供應鏈和產品開發，把這套沉澱成規模優勢；開市客開發成本和它一樣，但單個供應商拿到的訂單量只有山姆的零頭，這差距砸錢也追不回來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零售</span><span class=\"tag\">供應鏈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The Race to Replace Us With AI (with Garrison Lovely) universal labor-replacing machines capabilities overhang cognitive surrender tokenomics data unions\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-06-clearerthink-最早警告ai灭绝风险的人-后来亲手把它造了出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6c2f45dd923b89a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Clearer Thinking</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>最早警告AI滅絕風險的人，後來親手把它造了出來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">薩姆·奧特曼、達里奧·阿莫代伊等人早在成名前就公開說AI是生存風險，如今依然全速把它造出來；真正否認風險的，反倒是亞馬遜、微軟這類外部科技巨頭的CEO。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI政策</span><span class=\"tag\">不平等</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiEVO 130: The Stickleback Shuffle reciprocal transplant parallel evolution / repeated evolution behavioral fever CCR5-Δ32\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-06-thisweekinevol-同样是溪流之间搬家-刺鱼的适应差距比搬去湖泊还大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/56403d4659eeeed6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Evolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>同樣是溪流之間搬家，刺魚的適應差距比搬去湖泊還大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">瑞士伯爾尼團隊讓刺魚在四條看似相似的溪流和一個湖之間互相搬家做野外實驗，發現同類生境之間的本地獨有適應，貢獻了67%的適應度優勢，比生境本身差異的貢獻還大。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">進化生物學</span><span class=\"tag\">生態學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Cyber Risk Discourse is Broken open-weight models offense-defense gap air-gapped networks FelonyBench\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-06-interconnects-迄今网络攻击大多源自封闭模型-而非开源模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec9cbfcb9f273d26-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">9:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>迄今網絡攻擊大多源自封閉模型，而非開源模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">現有公開證據裡，導致網絡攻擊的大多是封閉模型而非開源模型；若按網絡風險封禁開源模型的邏輯，封閉模型的公開API也該一起禁掉，否則只會拉大攻防差距。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span>\n</div></div></a>"]